BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Classes October 2026: 4-Week Progressive Salsa Dance Lessons
  SF
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T203000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17912946@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:This Monday - NEW Salsa Dance Lessons Series in SF. Join the F
 UN.\n\nSalsa dancing is one of those things people put off for years — a
 nd then wish they'd started sooner. Get your 4-week series tickets: https:
 //salsamondays4weeks10-5-26.eventbrite.com\n\nThis is your month. Over fou
 r progressive Mondays in October\, you'll go from "I've never danced" to c
 onfidently dancing socially. Step by step\, no partner and no experience r
 equired.\n\nStarts Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, and meets every Monday in O
 ctober (Oct 5\, 12\, 19th\, 26) at SalsaCrazy Mondays\, Neck of the Woods\
 , San Francisco. One ticket covers the whole series\, and there's a huge s
 alsa dance party after class every single week.\n\nWHY THIS SERIES\n\nThis
  is San Francisco's most popular salsa night\, and it's built for real beg
 inners. Each week builds on the last\, so you're not memorizing random mov
 es — you're actually learning to dance. By the end of the month you'll b
 e dancing at the after-party with a room full of friendly people. No partn
 er needed. No experience needed. Just show up.\n\nPlease be aware - this i
 s simply the most popular salsa dance series in the entire Bay Area. There
  are a LOT of great people there\, and long lines to get in can develop (e
 specailly early\, which is when you should arrive).\n\nGet your 4-week ser
 ies tickets: https://salsamondays4weeks10-5-26.eventbrite.com (this saves 
 a lot of money!).\n\nNIGHTLY SCHEDULE\n\n6:30 PM — Doors open. Come earl
 y to grab a drink\, hear great music\, and beat the line.\n7:00 PM — Beg
 in...\n\n21+\; 4-week follower pass $120\; leader series sold out. Oct 5 c
 lass + dancing $40\; dancing only $10 + $1.49 fee. Current availability on
  Eventbrite.\nSalsaCrazy Mondays\n\nTickets: https://salsamondays4weeks10-
 5-26.eventbrite.com\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/salsa-
 classes-october-2026-4-week-progressive-salsa-dance-lessons-sf-tickets\nSo
 urce: DoTheBay
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:SalsaCrazy Mondays\, Neck of the Woods\, 406 Clement Street\, San
  Francisco\, CA\, 94118
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/salsa-classes-october-2026-4-wee
 k-progressive-salsa-dance-lessons-sf-tickets
END:VEVENT
