DESCRIPTION:Freight Train Lady\n\n(Record Release Show)\n\nFreight Train L
 ady is the song-conjuring project of Gabi Orion\, born in Santa Rosa and r
 aised between Point Reyes and the mountain. Brought to life by a band of l
 overs\, friends\, and family\, these are some country-fried lonesome jukeb
 ox fairy circle spells to heal the heart & soul.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nIndia
 nna Hale\n\nIndianna Hale is a multi instrumentalist singer songwriter bas
 ed in San Francisco.\n\n"Imagine Cate le Bon baking a sweet-but-not-too-sw
 eet birthday cake with Calvin Johnson\, wearing fuzzy warm sweaters and sl
 ippers and sipping home-fermented strawberry wine. This music sounds like 
 that to me." —Bill Baird\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nForest Floor\n\nForest Floo
 r is Geoff Saba's sonic adulation of the cosmos. Dualities such as composi
 tion and decomposition\, wave and particle\, and dark and light\, Saba pos
 its\, find no better microcosmic home than within sound. Forest Floor navi
 gates between order and chaos\, and endeavors to make sense of it all.\n\n
 Bandcamp | IG\n\nDOORS at 7:00PM | MUSIC at 8:00 PM\n\nTickets: https://ti
 cketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/19939?siteToken=d2atbcege5knqsavntt91g12
 50\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/live-music-freight-trai
 n-lady-indianna-hale-forest-floor-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
