DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17906394@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Every voice has a story worth hearing. The San Francisco Gay M
 en’s Chorus brings Broadway’s most powerful moments into an intimate c
 abaret setting\, featuring songs of courage\, longing\, and self-discovery
 . Through unforgettable solos\, duets\, and ensemble moments\, these songs
  reveal the power of speaking up\, standing tall\, and finding strength in
  vulnerability. Lean in\, listen closely\, and be moved by the voices that
  remind us that one song can spark momentum.\n\nTicket and Venue Informati
 on\n\n- Premium reserved table seating & general admission seating options
 .\n\n- GA seating is first come\, first served upon arrival.\n\n- Guests n
 eeding ADA or wheelchair seating contact SFGMC prior to arrival.\n\n- Pans
 y’s at The Chan\, bar and lounge\, opens one hour before showtime.\n\nBu
 y Tickets\n\nView complete event information at SFGMC.org\n\n$50 GA\, $65 
 Reserved\nSan Francisco Gay Men's Chorus Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.
 sfgmc.org/make-them-hear-you\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10
 /17/make-them-hear-you-an-sfgmc-cabaret-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
